#: ../../concepts/json-output.md:1
msgid "概念：命令输出契约"
msgstr "Concept: Command output contract"

#: ../../concepts/json-output.md:3
msgid "面向脚本的命令（`validate`、`inspect`）在 stdout 输出**恰好一个** JSON 信封："
msgstr "Script-facing commands (`validate`, `inspect`) write **exactly one** JSON envelope on stdout:"

#: ../../concepts/json-output.md:5
msgid "成功：`ok: true`，附带 `command` 和 `result`。"
msgstr "Success: `ok: true` with `command` and `result`."

#: ../../concepts/json-output.md:6
msgid "失败：`ok: false`，附带 `command` 和结构化的 `error`（`type`、`subtype`、`message`、`hint`）。"
msgstr "Failure: `ok: false` with `command` and a structured `error` (`type`, `subtype`, `message`, `hint`)."

#: ../../concepts/json-output.md:8
msgid "规则："
msgstr "Rules:"

#: ../../concepts/json-output.md:10
msgid "`--help` 和 `--version` 输出纯文本，不受信封约束。"
msgstr "`--help` and `--version` output plain text and are exempt from the envelope."

#: ../../concepts/json-output.md:11
msgid "进度、调试和诊断信息一律走 stderr，不污染 stdout 的 JSON 流。"
msgstr "Progress, debug, and diagnostic information always goes to stderr and never pollutes the stdout JSON stream."

#: ../../concepts/json-output.md:12
msgid "TUI 的交互画面走 stderr，stdout 保持未使用。"
msgstr "The TUI renders to stderr and leaves stdout unused."

#: ../../concepts/json-output.md:13
msgid "错误信封不是成功；解析时先读 `ok` 字段。"
msgstr "An error envelope is not a success; read the `ok` field first when parsing."

#: ../../concepts/json-output.md:15
msgid "脚本消费示例见[操作指南：在脚本和 CI 中消费命令输出](../how-to/use-json-output)。"
msgstr "A script-consumption example: [How-to: consuming command output in scripts and CI](../how-to/use-json-output)."
